This is the core part where you'll use the Npcap API to capture and decode packets.  Replace the `// Add Npcap capturing and decoding logic here` comment in `ServiceWorkerThread` with the following code:

```cpp
        pcap_if_t* alldevs;
        pcap_if_t* d;
        int i = 0;
        pcap_t* adhandle;
        char errbuf[PCAP_ERRBUF_SIZE];

        WriteToLog(L"Finding available devices...");

